{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/v8mfJGqlExFO8QDIUQ_xjQ?scene=1&click_id=3","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:42.132493+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/v8mfJGqlExFO8QDIUQ_xjQ?scene=1&click_id=3","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bR0IKGlicqjDVR0iaZU1Us7AQNtEU79bh2a5ngVdElfBQvLktYXLztBgm5kicicExlMR7LXZwFJAQ4L1R7ydTn152w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bR0IKGlicqjDVR0iaZU1Us7AQNtEU79bh2HZBicj1WqbTaE59ibrW9tttLaOvicKGkkUdMcASIeQUCVDwukjxs32kAA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bR0IKGlicqjDVR0iaZU1Us7AQNtEU79bh29x4iak6jnAt1t1NicHZtXdK6a7L5fUnfOnJfMO47u4ics0YkCVJtOKf9w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wM9Wh08JDNFQpKiaB20sCO8HfmNccroN5L2OHibgVGwMUmr6YM1KzfYM9ibfc6Xz41YMTDLV5h48h209jbZeE1qlQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section><section><section><section></section> </section></section></section><section><section><section><p>想在信息与通信工程领域深耕，依托优质平台开启科研之路吗？26 级研究生注意啦！东北大学计算机科学与工程学院智能无线通信与安全实验室导师团招生正式启动，诚邀怀揣科研热忱的你加入！</p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>一、</strong><strong>学校与学院介绍</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><p>东北大学始建于1923年4月，是一所具有爱国主义光荣传统的大学。于1998年9月划转为教育部直属高校，是国家首批“211工程”、“985工程”重点建设高校，2017年入选国家首轮世界一流大学建设高校，2022年入选国家第二轮“双一流”建设高校。  </p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A13hpyaUVDOH3vkeVufLZKz68cRvk3ga3rRYWgfl0VsFvNo3BRLgy8LbUWdA0Osjs19uandpeRNvWFeWQJOujQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p>计算机科学与工程学院现设有计算机科学系、计算机工程系、通信与电子工程系、人工智能系、基础教学部5个系部。信息与通信工程一级学科依托计算机学院，历史悠久，繁荣创新。</p><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A13hpyaUVDOH3vkeVufLZKz68cRvk3gavcvcAPE6s0pCwGL1uQPHwSJm3fUvthqyhAmbg8YsQl62fD89ibyUVyA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wM9Wh08JDNFQpKiaB20sCO8HfmNccroN53ic1Q07kQaic6tBicyKuu5q7w6iazMUaegk4aBNzmzJabYwVZwzdfaOTLg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>二、</strong><strong>实验室核心亮点</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>01</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong>前沿研究方向</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>聚焦智能无线通信（如 5G/6G 关键技术、无线资源优化）、图像处理（含计算机视觉、图像识别与</span><span>修复），贴合国家信息通信领域战略需求，科研成果落地性强。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong>02</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong>优质导师团队</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>导师以于尧教授为负责人，成员包括耿蓉和霍树伟副教授。导师均具备深厚学术背景与丰富项目经验，主持国家级 / 省部级科研项目，擅长因材施教，为学生定制科研与就业发展规划。</p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A13hpyaUVDOH3vkeVufLZKz68cRvk3ga2icW1qicPSFZVD9CLsnnVD9hECrJNdHtYKYPm8AWE8jXWAPsB35DOLHg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong>03</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong>一流科研平台</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p>配备先进的通信仿真软件、图像处理硬件设备，与企业、高校保持深度合作，为学生提供参与重大项目、学术交流的机会。</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong>04</strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong>完善培养支持</strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>提供充足科研</span><span>经费，支持参加国内外学术会议，助力学生发表高水平论文或实现高质量就业。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/A13hpyaUVDOH3vkeVufLZKz68cRvk3gatjMzVTFXuTpkWPiaOibYmWmPqQKPKVlduQ0ggr535rK7jEDRgjG8DHCw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wM9Wh08JDNFQpKiaB20sCO8HfmNccroN53ic1Q07kQaic6tBicyKuu5q7w6iazMUaegk4aBNzmzJabYwVZwzdfaOTLg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>三、</strong><strong>招生要求</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p>1. 预计能够获得所在学校的保研名额，硕士就读“信息与通信工程”或“通信工程”专业；</p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bo8X82iajCiciapVj59WvibYLl4W4lsQdJlzuibC6cV4FqFVtamnFgOTAKSu0x6KJZhhFfQlBbDGTfZynym2fAiahUBw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p>2. 对无线通信、图像处理领域有浓厚兴趣，具备扎实的数学基础、编程能力者优先；</p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wM9Wh08JDNFQpKiaB20sCO8HfmNccroN5L2OHibgVGwMUmr6YM1KzfYM9ibfc6Xz41YMTDLV5h48h209jbZeE1qlQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p>3. 学习态度端正，具备团队协作精神与自主科研潜力。</p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bo8X82iajCiciapVj59WvibYLl4W4lsQdJlzuibC6cV4FqFVtamnFgOTAKSu0x6KJZhhFfQlBbDGTfZynym2fAiahUBw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wM9Wh08JDNFQpKiaB20sCO8HfmNccroN53ic1Q07kQaic6tBicyKuu5q7w6iazMUaegk4aBNzmzJabYwVZwzdfaOTLg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>四、</strong><strong>报名方式</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p>1. 有意向者请发送个人简历（含本科成绩、科研 / 竞赛经历、技能证书等）至邮箱：gengrong@mail.neu.edu.cn，并抄送yuyao@mail.neu.edu.cn；huoshuwei@cse.neu.edu.cn。（邮件主题注明 “26 级推免研究生报名 - 姓名 - 本科院校”）；</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p>2. 报名截止时间：2025 年 9 月4 日(越早越好)；</p></section></section></section><section><p><br/></p></section><section><section><section><p>3. 通过初筛者将收到后续考核通知，包含：<br/>      • 个人考核（8月下旬）<br/>      • 导师组团队面试（9月上旬）</p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section> </section><section><section></section> </section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/wM9Wh08JDNFQpKiaB20sCO8HfmNccroN53ic1Q07kQaic6tBicyKuu5q7w6iazMUaegk4aBNzmzJabYwVZwzdfaOTLg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><br/></p><section><p><strong>学院预推免QQ群：1051308142</strong></p></section><p><br/></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"11e1f76e51c27a9f5327cef89cc6318e583b9e6c4e678fb9c07aec1e87add46b","textLength":936,"sourceSha256":"d43a9efcb62e4c39c9763105293c12f165900aa5f0ca5c4432e3473c74c07552","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0678ce3da74a9bbe5735","title":"2025年东北大学计算机科学与工程学院智能无线通信与安全实验室等你来","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:42.132493+00:00"}
